  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Indonesia Democratic Resilience Pilot Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to pilot approaches that help strengthen democratic institutions and processes in Indonesia, particularly for youth, women and people with disabilities. This will contribute to the long-term goal of &quot;all Indonesian citizens benefit from improved quality and consolidation of democracy&quot;, which is aligned with the Government of Indonesia&apos;s National Long Term Development Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
